{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265BN9qKPPFR1794645393.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天文台預測下周會有冷鋒橫過，下周五市區氣溫降至最低17度。</p><p></p><p>今天大致多雲，有一兩陣微雨。天文台預測下周一風勢較大，到下周三北風增強，預料屆時一道冷鋒會橫過華南沿岸，氣溫會顯著下降。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-1530_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026WHKKIJ5pxC1794645408.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>受隨後的東北季候風及雲帶影響，下周後期廣東沿岸早晚普遍清涼。下周四最低氣溫跌至20度以下，下周五17至20度。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T09:43:07.014575+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T08:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T11:37:42.525348+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T09:36:22.244065+00:00","content_hash":"312de816896080bbaec9b48384ed0ee3e4087c97319ec1c396022b1fcd54f8bd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}